  "title": "Christmas Wreath Cake",
  "description": "A really good fruit cake recipe, one you can eat the same day you make it; it&#39;s even better if you let sit for awhile. It&#39;s baked in a tube pan to make a wreath shape.",
  "authors": [
    "Karen D"
  ],
